WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.641 --> 00:00:09.105
[upbeat music]

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:10.189
[energy shatters]

00:00:10.356 --> 00:00:12.567
So what am I,
like, Asgardian or something?

00:00:13.693 --> 00:00:14.986
Dude, am I related to Thor?

00:00:14.986 --> 00:00:16.654
No, no, I didn't say
any of that.

00:00:16.904 --> 00:00:17.488
Bruno!

00:00:17.739 --> 00:00:18.323
Maybe.

00:00:19.699 --> 00:00:20.199
Thanks, man.

00:00:20.241 --> 00:00:25.580
[upbeat music continues]

00:00:25.913 --> 00:00:27.332
[energy whooshes away]

00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:29.751
[crash]

00:00:30.335 --> 00:00:31.002
Gah.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.838
Does this look like some kind
of writing to you?

00:00:33.838 --> 00:00:36.090
It's hard to read, um...

00:00:36.174 --> 00:00:38.968
Looks like Arabic or Urdu.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:40.053
I don't know.

00:00:40.303 --> 00:00:42.472
Okay, well, let's focus on
what we know.

00:00:42.972 --> 00:00:44.724
Light comes out of you
and it hardens.

00:00:44.849 --> 00:00:45.975
[energy growing]

00:00:46.225 --> 00:00:48.478
Let's call it hard-light.

00:00:48.686 --> 00:00:49.395
Groundbreaking.

